---
import Layout from "../components/Layout.astro";
import Links from "../components/Links.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<Layout
    title="About Ezekiel Akinfenwa — Full Stack Engineer & Designer"
    description="Full stack software engineer and designer based in Lagos, Nigeria. I build in Go, TypeScript and SvelteKit and care most about excellent user experience."
>
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="title">
            <span>Full Stack Software Engineer</span>
            <Icon name="tabler:code" />
            <span>& Designer</span>
            <Icon name="tabler:brush" />
        </h1>
        <Links />
        <div class="content">
            <strong>
                Hey there👋🏿, welcome to my little corner of the internet.
            </strong>
            <p>I'm Ezekiel, Software Developer based in Lagos, Nigeria.</p>
            <p>
                I enjoy exploring why things work, as it gives me a sense of
                control.
            </p>
            <p>
                I code in <Icon name="tabler:brand-golang" />golang and <Icon
                    name="tabler:brand-typescript"
                />typescript and I use <Icon
                    name="tabler:brand-svelte"
                />sveltekit as my framework of choice.
            </p>

            <p>
                I have built projects for clients and also for my school such as
                LogscribeAI for filling siwes logbooks and a telegram bot for
                announcements.
            </p>
            <p>
                I got into product development through a friend and the
                potential to build cool stuff. I mostly focus on excellent user
                experience.
            </p>
            <p>
                In my free time, I play storymode games like Hollow Knight
                Silksong and Scarlet Nexus. I also watch documentaries on tech
                history and societal issues.
            </p>
            <p>
                I listen to <Icon name="tabler:music" />Japanese jazz and <Icon
                    name="tabler:code"
                />code best under <Icon name="tabler:coffee" />lofi and chill
                music. <br> <br>Read some my <a href="/essays/"
                    >essays here <Icon name="tabler:arrow-up-right" /></a
                >
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .container {
        max-width: 768px;
        margin-inline: auto;
        padding-inline: 1rem;
        margin-block-start: 3rem;

        margin-block-end: 8rem;

        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;

        h1 {
            letter-spacing: -0.05em;
            line-height: 1;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-wrap: balance;

            svg {
                font-size: 2rem;
                display: inline-block;

                padding-inline-start: 0.25rem;
            }
        }

        div.content {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            line-height: 2;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        a {
            color: black;
        }

        @media (width > 1024px) {
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-block-start: 5rem;

            div.content {
                line-height: 2;
                margin-top: 3rem;
            }

            h1 {
                font-size: 3.5rem;

                svg {
                    font-size: 2.5rem;
                }
            }
        }
    }
</style>
